[statement]
Where several packages provide a name a dependency states, each installed
for another package, the walk follows the one apk installed first: `zp`,
which `d` requires, though `c`, which requires `bp`, comes before `d`.
apk decides `zp` first, since the walk numbers it after `bp`
(`decision-order/carried-names-are-decided-the-last-numbered-first`).

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:v

P:zp
V:1
p:v

P:bp
V:1
p:v

P:c
V:1
D:bp

P:d
V:1
D:zp

[request]
a
c
d

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install zp 1
install a 1
install bp 1
install c 1
install d 1
